    "PlayVictoryPoint is not gated by has_played_dev_card_this_turn -- every agent reveals VP cards immediately. This no longer affects win timing (engine.game.true_victory_points/_check_win auto-wins on a hidden VP card the instant the true total reaches 10, independent of when/whether it's revealed); it's noted here only as a residual agent-behavior quirk, not a win-timing bias.",
